01:20:19.000 --> 01:20:21.000
there's no relationship

01:20:21.000 --> 01:20:23.000
or chopped meat is $1.40 a pound

01:20:23.000 --> 01:20:25.000
in a non kosher butcher

01:20:25.000 --> 01:20:27.000
and it's $4 a pound for any kind of meat

01:20:27.000 --> 01:20:29.000
I don't know if it's better or worse

01:20:29.000 --> 01:20:31.000
I didn't tell you because I'm stuck with buying black kosher

01:20:31.000 --> 01:20:33.000
so I can't

01:20:33.000 --> 01:20:35.000
I don't eat meat anymore

01:20:35.000 --> 01:20:37.000
we almost don't eat meat anymore

01:20:37.000 --> 01:20:39.000
but if you take a young couple

01:20:39.000 --> 01:20:41.000
that is struggling to pay the rent

01:20:41.000 --> 01:20:43.000
what happens to them

01:20:43.000 --> 01:20:45.000
they either give it up or they become vegetarian

01:20:45.000 --> 01:20:47.000
and also

01:20:47.000 --> 01:20:49.000
secularism

01:20:49.000 --> 01:20:51.000
is

01:20:51.000 --> 01:20:53.000
this is the meaning of the whole notion of religion

01:20:53.000 --> 01:20:55.000
because

01:20:55.000 --> 01:20:57.000
we should be united

01:20:57.000 --> 01:20:59.000
and that's very important

01:20:59.000 --> 01:21:01.000
the Tora it comes to unite us

